    "background_image_text_rt88LE": {
      "type": "background-image-text",
      "name": "t:sections.background-image-text.presets.large_image_with_text_box.name",
      "settings": {
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "text": "<p>They question assumptions, challenge convention and obsess over the smallest details—because they understand that the biggest breakthroughs are often invisible. </p>",
        "button_label": "Notify when available",
        "button_link": "",
        "layout": "left",
        "height": 750,
        "parallax": true,
        "parallax_direction": "top"
      }
    },
    "background_image_text_EL6adb": {
      "type": "background-image-text",
      "name": "t:sections.background-image-text.presets.large_image_with_text_box.name",
      "settings": {
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "text": "<p>They know that the art and science of foiling are inseparable. That effortless style is born from engineering. That podiums are earned through an uncompromising devotion to detail.</p>",
        "button_label": "Notify when available",
        "button_link": "",
        "layout": "right",
        "height": 750,
        "parallax": true,
        "parallax_direction": "top"
      }
    },
    "background_image_text_FF8cVG": {
      "type": "background-image-text",
      "name": "t:sections.background-image-text.presets.large_image_with_text_box.name",
      "settings": {
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "text": "<p>The best ideas aren't born in CAD alone, nor solely on the water. They emerge through a continual conversation between design and experience, where every session informs the next iteration, and every iteration is judged by a single question: <strong>does it make the ride better?</strong></p>",
        "button_label": "Notify when available",
        "button_link": "",
        "layout": "left",
        "height": 750,
        "parallax": true,
        "parallax_direction": "top"
      }
    },
    "rich_text_VrFgX6": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_zbVKWE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<h1>A RIIFT collective.</h1>"
          }
        },
        "text_VHR8Bh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>We haven't assembled a roster of ambassadors—we've built a collective of people whose ideas shape everything we create. They challenge our thinking, test our assumptions and raise the standard for what great equipment should feel like.</p><p>The result is more than a team. It's a community united by curiosity, intelligent design and an uncompromising pursuit of surf feel. Because the future of foiling won't be defined by the people who ride it best—it will be defined by the people who think about it differently.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_zbVKWE",
        "text_VHR8Bh"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
