        "divider": false
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_jWzrAC": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "custom_css": [
        "p {font-size: 16px;}"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image_mask": "landscape",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "RIIFT ATHLETE",
        "title": "kane dewilde",
        "text": "<p>Kane De Wilde isn’t just one of the world’s best foilers—he’s one of the sport’s most influential thinkers. Equal parts athlete, engineer and obsessive tinkerer, Kane has spent years questioning convention and rethinking what’s possible on foil. From board design and hydrodynamics, to foils, wings and riding technique, his fingerprints are everywhere in modern foiling.<br/><br/>His curiosity has led to countless breakthroughs, but perhaps none more significant than recognising the importance of placing mass directly above the foil’s centre of lift—a principle that became fundamental to the RIIFT platform.<br/></p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "66",
        "layout": "right",
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_AqHr8E": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "custom_css": [
        "p {font-size: 16px;}"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image_mask": "none",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "RIIFT ATHLETE",
        "title": "jarrod snow",
        "text": "<p>A world-class downwind racer and one of the most respected board designers in foiling, Jarrod is living proof that craftsmanship and performance are inseparable. Every rail, rocker line and volume distribution has been tested where it matters most—under the feet of someone trying to win.<br/><br/>Jarrod’s obsession with balance, early release and efficient planing had a profound influence on the way RIIFT integrates into the board itself. His philosophy aligned perfectly with ours: don’t build around the technology, build around the ride. When your shaper is also the rider crossing the finish line first, every detail matters.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "66",
        "layout": "left",
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_7Dw666": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "custom_css": [
        "p {font-size: 16px;}"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image_mask": "landscape",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "RIIFT ATHLETE",
        "title": "Nathan Van Vuuren",
        "text": "<p>Born on Maui and now pushing the sport forward from South Africa, Nathan Van Vuuren embodies the rare intersection where elite performance and exceptional design become one. His effortless flow on the water is anything but effortless—it's the product of an obsessive pursuit of design, where every session becomes another prototype and every ride another opportunity to refine an idea.</p><p>As a designer, innovator and partner at SPG Foils, Nathan understands that the art and science of foiling are inseparable. Every detail matters, because true performance isn't measured by complexity, but by how naturally it disappears beneath the rider. His unmistakable style is the purest expression of that philosophy: precise, intuitive and beautifully composed.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "66",
        "layout": "right",
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true
      }
    },
